{"id":"sinnlos","lemma":"sinnlos","pos":"adj","rank":2352,"glosses":["meaningless, pointless, senseless","excessive, disproportionate"],"ipa":"/ˈzɪnloːs/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/fe/De-sinnlos.ogg/De-sinnlos.ogg.mp3","forms":{"comparative":"sinnloser","superlative":"am sinnlosesten"},"examples":[{"text":"Mein Leben wäre ohne euch sinnlos.","en":"My life would be meaningless without you.","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"a state in which…"},{"g":"to be","l":"sein"},{"g":"without"},{"g":"you (pl.)","l":"ihr"},null]},{"text":"Meine Arbeit ist sinnlos.","en":"My job is meaningless.","words":[{"g":"my","l":"mein"},{"g":"toil"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null]},{"text":"Das, was Sie sagen, ist sinnlos.","en":"What you're saying is meaningless.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"what"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to say (to pronounce"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null]},{"text":"Es ist sinnlos, es zu versuchen.","en":"It's useless to try.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"it"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to try, to attempt"}]},{"text":"Es scheint alles sinnlos zu sein.","en":"It all seems pointless.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/758446","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"to shine","l":"scheinen"},{"g":"everything"},null,{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to be"}]}]}